的課業·意外之題</color>後，菲謝爾將成為<color=#FFD780FF>魔導</color>角色。隊伍中編入至少2名魔導角色時，將獲得<color=#FFD780FF>魔導·秘儀</color>效果，使魔導角色獲得強化。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>魔導·秘儀</color>\\n見證無數世界淪入寂滅的夜鴉親王奧茲華爾多·赫芙那梵茵斯啊，頌唱獻給皇女的幽夜七重奏吧。此即為匯聚於因果終結地的靈魂裁滅命運漆黑的深罪之刻——\\n此外，奧茲在場上時，隊伍中的角色還會獲得額外的強化效果：\\n·隊伍中附近的角色觸發超載反應後的10秒內，菲謝爾與隊伍中附近的目前場上其他角色的攻擊力提升22.5%。\\n·隊伍中附近的角色觸發感電或月感電反應後的10秒內，菲謝爾與隊伍中附近的目前場上其他角色元素精通提升90點。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Fischl_07","linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":311,"name":"幽邃鴉眼","description":"奧茲不在戰場上時，也會透過鴉眼守望菲謝爾。在菲謝爾對敵人進行普通攻擊時，奧茲會通過鴉眼協力攻擊，造成22%攻擊力的傷害。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Fischl_01","advancedProps":[{"name":"Coordinated Attack","elementalGaugeTheory":"—","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"—"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"—"}},"interruptionResistance":"30","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Mute","horizontalForce":"0","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":312,"name":"聖裁影羽","description":"施放<color=#FFD780FF>夜巡影翼</color>時，能額外造成200%攻擊力的傷害，並使影響範圍擴大50%。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Fischl_02"},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":313,"name":"淵色黑翼","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>夜巡影翼</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Fischl_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":314,"name":"皇女幻綺譚","description":"施放<color=#FFD780FF>至夜幻現</color>時，會對周圍的敵人造成222%攻擊力的<color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素傷害</color>；\\n技能效果結束時，會為菲謝爾恢復20%生命值。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Fischl_03","advancedProps":[{"name":"Extra Electro DMG","elementalGaugeTheory":"2U","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"Elemental Burst"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"5s/4 Hits"}},"interruptionResistance":"500","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":315,"name":"至夜默示錄","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>至夜幻現</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Fischl_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":316,"name":"永夜之禽","description":"奧茲的存在時間延長2秒。此外，奧茲會隨當前場上自己的角色一起攻擊，造成菲謝爾30%攻擊力的<color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素</color>傷害。","descriptionBuff":"奧茲的存在時間延長2秒。此外，奧茲會協同目前場上自己的角色一起攻擊，造成菲謝爾30%攻擊力的<color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素傷害</color>。\\n奧茲進行協同攻擊後，<color=#FFD780FF>魔女的前夜禮·宵世幻奏</color>中提升攻擊力與元素精通的效果提高100%，持續10秒。","extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Fischl_04","advancedProps":[{"name":"Coordinated Attack","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"Elemental Skill"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"5s/4 Hits"}},"interruptionResistance":"10","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Mute","horizontalForce":"0","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]}},"dictionary":null,"buff":true}}